## Guide book
lw_p1.guide.title=§l§6Train Passenger Handbook
lw_p1.guide.indexHint=§7Select a chapter§r
lw_p1.guide.prev=← Previous
lw_p1.guide.next=Next →
lw_p1.guide.ch.overview=§lOverview
lw_p1.guide.ch.roles=§lRoles
lw_p1.guide.ch.tasks=§lTasks
lw_p1.guide.ch.items=§lItems & Shop
lw_p1.guide.ch.note=§lNote
lw_p1.guide.ch.config=§lConfig
lw_p1.guide.overview.body=§fA speeding train, a journey hiding murder.\nWill you reach the station alive?\n§fTrain Werewolf is a multiplayer deduction game.\n§e5-15 players§f, about §e10 minutes§f per round.\n\n§lRules§r\n§f1. Once everyone boards, the train departs\n2. Roles are assigned at random: §cKiller§f, §bOfficer§f, §aPassenger§f\n3. The Killer eliminates passengers in secret while passengers try to expose them\n\n§lWin conditions§r\n§aPassengers§f: the Killer dies / the train arrives\n§cKiller§f: all passengers die\n\n§7Map name: %s\n§7Map author: %s\n§7Addon author: Xiaopa baka (LW Realm Studio)
lw_p1.guide.roles.body=· §c§lKiller§r\n§fHides among the passengers and aims to eliminate them all. Owns the §eKiller Shop§f.\n\n· §b§lOfficer§r\n§fThe only law enforcer, armed with a §eRevolver§f.\n\n· §a§lPassenger§r\n§fNo weapons, no privileges, and the largest group on board.\n\n\n
lw_p1.guide.tasks.body=§fTasks are given out at random after the game starts. The timer shows on the XP bar.\n§cFailing to finish in time kills you§f\n\n§b§lTask list§r\n§eVentilation§f: go to the train head or tail to get some air\n§eSleep§f: lie down on a bed\n§eEat§f: eat any food\n§eDrink§f: drink anything - §7a Cigarette completes it instantly§f\n§eToilet§f: crouch at the toilet - §7a Mineral Water Bottle completes it instantly§f\n§eSocialize§f: stand near another player for a while
lw_p1.guide.items.body=§c§lKiller Shop items:§r\n§fDagger · Derringer · Crowbar · Lockpick · Poison · Baseball Bat · Grenade · Power Cutter\n\n§b§lCommon items§r\n§fNote · Revolver (Officer) · Mineral Water · Mineral Water Bottle · Magic Conch · Father's Pocket Watch · Wild Royal Jelly\n\n§eKiller Shop§f: killers carry their own shop with exclusive items\n§eVending Machine§f: buy special items from the vending machines on the train
lw_p1.guide.note.body=§lNote system§r\n§fEveryone starts with one Note, locked to the inventory.\n· Use on empty space → edit the message\n Use on a player → send the note\n· On death the message stays on your corpse\n\n\n\n\n§7The note is the only way to communicate in this game!\n
lw_p1.guide.config.body=Use a §eStick§f to open the config menu and change game settings\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n

